  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 567.02 Recipient Eligibility. All medicaid recipients shall be eligible for hearing aid services, in accordance with He-W 567.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #6157, eff 12-29-95, EXPIRED: 12-29-03\n\nNew. #9480, eff 5-23-09, EXPIRED: 5-23-17\n\nNew. #12538, eff 5-25-18",
